{:activity/_scope [{:activity/expected-seconds 420.0 :activity/first-step {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101859} :activity/id #uuid "d0d06916-b04a-5057-b794-744d1e7a0e9f" :activity/scope {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048863} :activity/steps [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101859 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101954 :tutorial/content "If we want to add (or subtract) three or more matrices, all operations should be done elementwise. For example, suppose\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nThen we can calculate ${A}+{B}-{C}$ by performing the operations on each corresponding entry, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+B-C & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1+(-1)-0 \\\\ 1+2-5 \\\\ -1+0-(-2)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :tutorial/id #uuid "f6d0bdee-d80b-596a-bef2-41b2d6429eeb" :tutorial/math-academy-id 2973 :tutorial/title "Introduction"} :step/id #uuid "843ddc26-4ece-5c0c-b76f-eb3b2ae356b8" :step/math-academy-id 464512 :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101860}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101860 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100991 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100686 :question/id #uuid "0928c2fa-a772-5d39-a638-1b1d0e71be2f" :question/math-academy-id "e-4378" :question/problem "Calculate $A-(B-C),$ where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(B-C) & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}-(\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-1-0 & -1-(-5) \\\\ 2-1 & 0-1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1-(-1) & 0-4 \\\\ 2-1 & -2-(-1)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "667ac53c-36b8-56a0-9699-fe27c8373c6b" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049304}] :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186549194 :question-generator/id #uuid "dc71b24c-40dc-53be-9574-40a00b2b2f9c" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186100991.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101106 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "850af764-4ddb-53d3-a63a-0f8b3db18d54" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186097972} {:answer/id #uuid "8e99ffbb-c95b-55f0-9ddd-98f9bebe3612" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186097973} {:answer/id #uuid "d0f41abb-2f98-5827-a0ee-deaf9afa93b6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 5 \\\\ 4 & 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186097974} {:answer/id #uuid "fc7a4b9b-a1dc-5efe-9b1f-ac9b6d14126e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186097975} {:answer/id #uuid "0f17d20b-3eff-5ffe-8fdd-b191346f0b57" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186097976}] :a